/* 600 từ TOEIC thiết yếu — 600 words. Source notes: based on the 50-lesson topic list of Lin Lougheed, "600 Essential Words for the TOEIC" (Barron's), cross-checked with parroto.app/vocabulary/toeic-600 and lingolandedu.com TOEIC essential 600 lists. Topic order preserved. A few in-list duplicates/low-value items replaced with required TOEIC words (warranty, applicant, reimburse, pension, invoice, postpone, exhibit); phrasal headwords with "be" shortened (made of, in charge of, aware of, ready for, accustomed to). */
